    <title><![CDATA[2001: A Space Odyssey - Videophone Sequence<br />
<br />
]]></title>
    <summary><![CDATA[A clip from &quot;2001: A Space Odyssey&quot; demonstrating one of the earliest cinematic depictions of a videophone, showcasing director Stanley Kubrick&#039;s visionary portrayal of future technology. The sequence is noted for its prescient depiction of communication technology.]]></summary>
    <updated>2024-04-07T21:24:49+00:00</updated>
